5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current system is failing. We need a structure that accounts for actual costs and labor.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the time commitment. We need to know the true hours involved before agreeing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current distribution feels uneven. I want to see where the usage and the work actually sit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. I want predictability and consistency.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care most about keeping our relationships intact. We need a solution that prevents conflict.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, time is a cost. We should look at the receipts to see the financial burden too.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, financials are important, but I need to verify the time. I will check the timing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the calendar to see who is actually here to do the work.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I will check the chat logs to see what triggers our arguments.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will read the note from the previous tenants to see what went wrong for them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the management office rates to see if outsourcing is viable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I will also check what each person considers ""done"" to understand the standard.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also watch the kitchen for a fortnight to see who uses it most.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will also check the bathroom grout status to see how fast it degrades.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also check the standard terms of the outside firm to see their requirements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let's gather this data before we decide.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes. Data first, then decisions.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Sounds reasonable. I will start the kitchen watch immediately.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,Okay. I hope this clarifies things.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can find a balance that works for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
